Z||000000||GarethWright||03-21-2001||01:08 AM||||Well, after running a tank and a bit with the new TPS on, I can report no better gas mileage, still right at 14.5mpg, but the car doesn't hesitate quite as badly as it used too, but still a little. Weekend project is to clean out my throttle body and see what I can do to the injectors, see if that helps any.<BR>I am afraid to run the compression test, as if I KNOW something is wrong, I will have to fix it, and I can't afford anything Major right now, so I will just have to go on wondering until my bank account gets a little fatter.<BR>Happy Motoring all!<BR>Gareth.||||reg||1
